<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kore &#40;Kore&#41;<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kore<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, May 19, 2004 - 6:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Does anyone have thoughts on wether the Fager murders were the work of BTK ?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4-->
<!--Post: 11--><!--Time: 1085084586-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Prairie_chicken &#40;Prairie_chicken&#41;<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Prairie_chicken<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 20, 2004 - 1:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I really believe that the Fager family was killed by Kelli Fagers Pakistani boyfriend.  Butterworth testified that he had seen him at the home in the morning with Kelli in her bedroom for just a moment before the boyfriend shut the bedroom door. He then took off for Pakistan after he was questioned only briefly one time.  I think he drove BB&#39;s van to the parking lot where it was found, which was by the McDonalds where Kelli worked, and by the apartment where he lived.  BB took the family&#39;s car.  who knows why?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11-->
<!--Post: 12--><!--Time: 1085088383-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Laoise &#40;Laoise&#41;<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Laoise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 20, 2004 - 2:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Nope...I personally feel it was btk who did the killings. I think he hadnt expected BB to come back that day and thought he was in the clear as far as timing went and was quite surprised when BB did come back. I also think he set BB up as a fall guy so to speak when he sent bill away in the family car. Then, since he had been seen and couldnt necessarily trust that bill would keep quiet, he wrote the letter saying he didnt do it... honestly, i think the fagers were the only big mistake this man ever made... <BR>but thats just my opinion!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12-->
<!--Post: 13--><!--Time: 1085090818-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sirfritz &#40;Sirfritz&#41;<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sirfritz<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 20, 2004 - 3:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->But how could he know that BB would do something as weird as drive to Florida? <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13-->
<!--Post: 14--><!--Time: 1085092305-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST14"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bogey<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bogey<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 20, 2004 - 3:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I still think the real killer was B. Butterworth!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 14-->
<!--Post: 23--><!--Time: 1085161258-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST23"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, May 21, 2004 - 10:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Just to stay organized, I started a new thread on Butterworth and moved a couple of the posts there. <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/9/15.html?1085102631"> <b>Here&#39;s a link</b></a>.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 23-->
<!--Post: 1038--><!--Time: 1095252055-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1038"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, September 15, 2004 - 5:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I read on another discussion board that the semen at the Fager murders &#40;I did not know that there was semen left&#41; did not match the suspect. Does anyone know more details about the murders? Just because BTK sent a letter that he did not do it does not mean that he did not kill those people. There is alot of similarity and &#39;coincidence&#39; between their deaths and other BTK crimes. There is supposed to be a book coming out about the trial associated with the Fager murders, as per the info from the other board.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1038-->
<!--Post: 1149--><!--Time: 1097454823-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1149"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Quell<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Quell<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, October 10, 2004 - 5:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK may indeed be a drifter.  He needed a car so he took it and drove it to Florida.  Was the car ever recovered?  There are many cars found in that state that are dredged out of canals.  Some have bodies in them, and many are stolen.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1149-->
<!--Post: 1219--><!--Time: 1097786434-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1219"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nostone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nostone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, October 14, 2004 - 1:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t think this is BTK.  It&#39;s got to be BB.  Why would he drive to FL?  That just doesn&#39;t make sense. <BR> <BR>As far as semen left at the scene of the Fagers, LE could compare it to the semen left at the Otero crime scene.  Seems to me that they would have.  I imagine they would have linked it to BTK if the semen matched.  If there was semen at the Fager scene, that is.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1219-->
<!--Post: 1951--><!--Time: 1103161626-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1951"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, December 15, 2004 - 5:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I can imagine him driving to Florida or just anywhere. Not everyone keeps a cool head. It is not unusual for people under severe stress/trauma to do things and come around hours/days later. The age old question: why didn&#39;t you turn off the ignition? Why didn&#39;t you step on the brake? etc. It is called panic. Amnesia also occurs during these kinds of events. I cannot even imagine the horror of seeing the Fager family or the Otero family after they were brutally murdered. And bear in mind that not half has been told to the public. These were blood baths. The human mind is still the last frontier and man will conquer space before he ever begins to understand the human heart, the mind, the brain, and the gut feelings/intuitions that are possessed by us. If we understood ourselves, BTK would not be a serial killer.    <BR> <BR>If BTK did not commit the Fager murders, then he copycated the one who did. I cannot imagine that he is not responsible for these deaths as well.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1951-->
<!--Post: 4214--><!--Time: 1105891969-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4214"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Essevi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Essevi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 16, 2005 - 8:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Teardrop-- <BR> <BR>Please explain why you used the term &#34;bloodbaths&#34; to describe the murders? The only blood was from Mr. Fager who was shot, I believe in the back, the daughters were drowned or strangled, no blood. <BR> <BR>Mr. Otero, according to Charlie, had bitten his tongue, so the term &#34;bloodbath&#34; seems to be an exaggeration. I am aware that Mrs. Otero fought back, but bloodbath?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4214-->
<!--Post: 9265--><!--Time: 1109457575-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9265"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bulldog87<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bulldog87<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 2:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Any possibilty that this might still be a btk murder?  D.R. is said to have work at a security firm &#40;adt&#41;. I think at the time they had question about why the system wasnt activated. Been a long time and i was just a kid.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9265-->
<!--Post: 9314--><!--Time: 1109469210-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9314"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 5:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sorry to reply so late. I think that it was a slaughter in terms of devastation and loss of life. Perhaps there was not literal blood everywhere. We still do not know all the facts. I do think that BTK did this killing. Bondage, strangulation, and posing are rare for most killers. For all three to occur in this homicide, and incidently coincide to BTK&#39;s signature, means that they still have another vicious serial killer to find. I do not think that BB killed these people. I would not have put it passed BTK to allow someone to go to prison, and years later admit to the killing in one of his letters. Control and anger are his motivations. <BR> <BR>It will be interesting to see if any souvenirs are found from the Fagers.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9314-->
<!--Post: 9467--><!--Time: 1109536169-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9467"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Verm_inve<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Verm_inve<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 12:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There are SO many similarities, but why the letter? <BR> <BR>Then agian the letter was never released.  No on knows what it really says ...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9467-->
<!--Post: 10462--><!--Time: 1109967254-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10462"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 12:14 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->hey Verm can you give me a date and place for these murders?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10462-->
<!--Post: 10534--><!--Time: 1109985701-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10534"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dpinva<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dpinva<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 5:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I will not be the least bit surprised if &#40;perhaps WHEN is the better modifier here&#41; Mr. Rader is charged with these crimes as well.  <BR> <BR>The only reason that most people do NOT subscribe to the theory that the Fager murders were committed by BTK is because of a letter that was received by LE, the contents of which are not even known to the public.  <BR> <BR>There are so many similarities between these murders and the Otero murders that I don&#39;t see any reasonable possibility that the deaths of the Fagers were NOT at the hands of BTK.  <BR> <BR>I am almost positive that the Fagers were murdered by BTK. They are probably only a few of the yet undiscovered innocent victims of a man who may turn out to be one of the most prlific destryers of innocence, life and hope in modern history. Btk killed the Fagers. And probably many more that we have yet to even hear the names of yet. Count on it. Dennis Rader is not ust a serial killer. He is evil walking, and walking for 31 years.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10534-->
